# server.cfg patch — append "car_azelow" to the existing filterscripts line.
#
# Current (FTP /server.cfg):
#   filterscripts inv_ui helmet vice ipdata bank_ui
#
# After:
#   filterscripts inv_ui helmet vice ipdata bank_ui car_azelow
#
# Apply by either:
#   - editing server.cfg manually on the FTP, OR
#   - running deploy/deploy_to_ftp.sh which calls the lftp script below.
#
# The order matters: car_azelow loads last, so it does not interfere with
# bank_ui's textdraws.
